            "notes": "# **Power**  [Spynstem Update](item_9fbbe756-5dd6-44f6-abd8-a8355f0be2b5) \n\nThis is the only power that I think isn't self-explanatory if you haven't played an Orisa ult build, which this is, technically. At least, the powers are built for her ult.  [Spynstem Update](item_9fbbe756-5dd6-44f6-abd8-a8355f0be2b5) basically supercharges your ult energy and pairing it with centripetal charge means you can get it back really often.\n\n# -----------------------------------\n\n# **Items**\n\n###  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) \n\nThis is an extremely expensive item. I'd prefer to sell  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) over  [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) but I find that most rounds I do not have the cash for that",
